    "answer": {
      "short": "$3(4x-3y)(4x+3y)$\n\nTake out $3$, then factorise the difference of squares.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}48x^2-27y^2&=3(16x^2-9y^2)\\\\48x^2-27y^2&=3\\big((4x)^2-(3y)^2\\big)\\\\48x^2-27y^2&=3(4x-3y)(4x+3y)\\end{align*}$$",
